This is a copy of mini-xml release 4.0.6 with the following modifications:

 o Add our own Makefile, Makefile.nmake, config.h.ms, config.h.unix,
   README.evalresp

 o Remove the 'doc', 'linux', 'vcnet' and 'xcode' directories, the autoconf
   build files, packaging files and fuzzing inputs

Our build target is libmxmlev.a instead of the default libmxml4.a.
